    ///
    /// ## Cardinality: Optional, Multiple (0..*)
    ///
    /// ## Special Semantics
    /// - Included in summary
    ///
    /// ## Constraints
    /// - **ele-1**: All FHIR elements must have a @value or children unless an empty Parameters resource (error)
